|---|---|---|---|
| O01 | Eight latest canonical technical PNG files are not mounted here | Labeled layout schematics / reserved closing slots; no older replacements | Local asset agent |
| O02 | Current local manuscript and component/router changes after inherited v1 pin | Prototype text is layout content; inspect current hand edits and lockfile first | Local implementation lead |
| O03 | Actual original lab captures/public source URLs for method summaries | Show summary type and limits; do not invent logs or hashes | Evidence reviewer |
| O04 | Existing date conflicts in research handoff | Preserve event/receipt/revalidation distinction; do not infer exact interval dates | Editorial/source reviewer |
| O05 | Hosted Back/Forward, direct refresh and new-tab route traversal could not be tested here | Real static pages supplied, tests listed as pending | Local browser QA |
| O06 | Current Astro ClientRouter ownership | Default proposed native reading-route group; no untested dual popstate controller | Front-end architect |
| O07 | Safari/iOS/Firefox/manual assistive-technology validation | Chromium DOM tests only; no conformance claim | Accessibility/browser QA |
| O08 | Final hero crop and approved portrait | Actual hero plus NM monogram; do not regenerate a portrait | Nick / visual owner |
| O09 | Optional older managed-variation and trust-chain rasters still have semantic holds | Use labeled HTML explanation where appropriate; no implicit clearance | Evidence/visual reviewer |
| O10 | Final manuscript length/read time and publication metadata | No invented publication date or read time in prototype | Editor |
| O11 | Fine-grained indexing/canonical policy for detail routes | Define parent relationship; no duplicate-essay publication record | Site owner |
| O12 | Fonts and exact visual matching across browsers | Reuse current licensed fonts locally; validate with final assets | Site implementer |

The handoff is implementation-directed design, not a merged Astro patch, deployment, publication approval or fresh attestation of the lab systems.

