_handoff/rw-v2/legs/qa-closeout-3.log:2096:_handoff/rw-v2/legs/p0d-p1.log:1100:| Read this scene in essay | Close focus then deliberate jump | Explicit anchor navigation | Chosen scene, not old reading point |
_handoff/rw-v2/legs/qa-closeout-3.log:2122:_handoff/rw-v2/legs/p0d-p1.log:1126:Only one modal DOM node is open at a time. A logical parent stack is permitted. Store each parent's scroll and local expansion state before replacing the host. Restoring an evidence view must restore open receipts, not recreate a collapsed set at the top.
_handoff/rw-v2/legs/qa-closeout-3.log:2134:_handoff/rw-v2/legs/p0d-p1.log:1138:Stable receipt IDs do not prove sources. Only source records populate public capture links. Sanitize before bundling content into HTML, JSON or static routes. A collapsed disclosure or modal is not access control. Do not ship internal IPs, credentials, private tracker IDs or unapproved raw logs in a hidden component.
_handoff/rw-v2/legs/qa-closeout-3.log:2273:_handoff/rw-v2/legs/p0d-p1.log:1277:Manual collapse takes precedence over proximity-triggered expansion. Holding a beat pins the **preview**, not the physical page or actual reading position. Display both when different: “Held preview: Use · Reading: Drift.” Default follow mode updates only sidebar context. It must never swap the inline canonical figure or automatically scroll the article.
_handoff/rw-v2/legs/qa-closeout-3.log:2294:_handoff/rw-v2/legs/p0d-p1.log:1298:At top: Back to essay (in-place entry only), view label, Copy link, Close. “Read this scene in the essay” is separate: it deliberately jumps to the chosen beat instead of restoring the original reading position.
_handoff/rw-v2/legs/qa-closeout-3.log:2320:_handoff/rw-v2/legs/p0d-p1.log:1324:Evidence label is not evidence quality. “Externally reported” means attributed, not validated by us. “Measured” requires a stated method and denominator; it does not automatically mean causal. “Implemented” is a separate maturity dimension, not a synonym for “Observed.” A green color alone may not collapse these distinctions.
